WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.745
Scenes capture every setting at once.

2
00:00:02.745 --> 00:00:05.344
The timeline blends from one scene to the next.

3
00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:09.374
Double-click the Scenes track near the start, to capture the current look.

4
00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:11.088
Now change the look.

5
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:14.375
Apply the Amber Terminal preset, and push the depth.

6
00:00:17.228 --> 00:00:20.200
Double-click at bar four, to capture the second scene.

7
00:00:20.655 --> 00:00:21.972
Rewind, and press Play.

8
00:00:21.972 --> 00:00:25.066
The picture travels from the first look to the second.

9
00:00:30.855 --> 00:00:35.359
Right-click a scene marker to preview it, replace its snapshot, or change its easing.

10
00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:39.355
Keyframes and scenes work together on one timeline.

11
00:00:39.355 --> 00:00:40.742
Next: the Patch Bay.
